  "description": "The Location: A Unique Opportunity\nSituated at the most strategic point of the Puerto Aventuras marina, where the Caribbean extends into the serenity of the canals, Casa La Torre redefines exclusivity. Facing a shore of preserved tropical vegetation, it offers a panoramic view that no other property can match.\n\nCasa La Torre: Between Heritage and Modernity\nBuilt in 2003 and featuring a masterful renovation in 2022, this 7,535 sq.ft. Villa on an 8,944 sq.ft. lot combines coastal charm with contemporary luxury.\n• Master Suites: 2 exceptional suites on the main floor with deep canal views and access to a wide balcony.\n• Themed Bedrooms: 4 additional bedrooms, each with a unique identity.\n• Bath Spaces: 4 bathrooms with walk-in showers, whirlpool tubs, natural materials, and fine cabinetry.\n• Living and Dining Room: An open concept of 1,250 sq.ft. with contemporary furniture and solid wood. The large windows slide away to merge the interior with the covered terrace.\n• Chef’s Kitchen: An elegant space with solid granite countertops and a central island, ideal for entertaining in an authentic atmosphere.\n\nThe Exterior: An Art of Living\nWhat makes this property unique is not just its size, but its details designed for water enthusiasts.\n• Private Waterfront: 150 ft. of canal frontage with a private dock.\n• Outdoor Oasis: A 381 sq.ft. pool with a water fountain feature and a sun-terrace with spectacular views.\n• High-End Palapa: A 452 sq.ft. area featuring a summer kitchen and lounge.\n• Rooftop: A 3,035 sq.ft. space with a partial ocean view and 36 solar panels.\n• Collector’s Garage: A 1,345 sq.ft. garage\n• Nautical Garage: For 2 jet skis, paddleboards, and equipment.\n\nLifestyle and Investment\nWhether a primary residence or a strategic wealth asset, Casa La Torre embodies the perfect harmony between the pleasure of the sea and the security of a sustainable investment.",
